k privileges and security considerations.Prepare the network for MID Servers to connect with the instance and access the download site. The network must be prepared before installing or configuring the MID Server. If computers or devices have additional security measures, that security may interfere with MID Servers on those systems.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/servicenow-platform/mid-server/c\\_MIDServerConnectionPrerequisites.html","release":"australia","product":"MID Server","classification":"mid-server","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":11,"breadcrumb":["Configuring MID Server","MID Server","Manage instance data sources","Extend ServiceNow AI Platform capabilities"],"tags":["#servicenow-platform","#mid-server","#on-premise","#proxy","#connectivity","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:ServiceNowOfficialDocs/servicenow-platform/mid-server/c_MIDServerConnectionPrerequisites.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"joncdr","at":1784561353168},"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/servicenow-platform/mid-server/c_MIDServerConnectionPrerequisites.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,20],"size":1068,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
